# snap-extract project registry
#
# Copy to ~/.config/snap-extract/projects.conf, edit, then run:
#   contrib/hypr/snapx-keybinds.sh
#
# One project per line, pipe-separated:
#
#   key | label | path | extensions [| extra flags]
#
#   key         the letter you press after the leader key. Must be unique.
#   label       shown in the on-screen menu.
#   path        project root. ~ is expanded.
#   extensions  comma-separated, passed to --ext.
#   extra       optional; any further snap-extract flags for this project.
#
# Blank lines and # comments are ignored.
#
# Each project gets two bindings:
#   <key>          screenshot a file tree inside that project
#   SHIFT <key>    copy the project's whole tree, no screenshot
#
# Keep the letter mnemonic — you are choosing these to be muscle memory.

s | strojx      | ~/projects/strojx           | .ts,.tsx,.json,.md | --exclude "*.test.ts"
e | elo v2      | ~/projects/elo-evolution-v2 | .ts,.tsx,.md
d | dotfiles    | ~/projects/ghost-dotfiles   | .sh,.conf,.zsh,.md
n | notes       | ~/notes                     | .md
